flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Read n/]
    B --> C{n ≤ 1?}
    C -->|Yes| D[/Print Not prime/]
    D --> Z([Stop])
    C -->|No| E[i ← 2, isPrime ← true]
    E --> F{i × i ≤ n?}
    F -->|Yes| G{n mod i = 0?}
    G -->|Yes| H[isPrime ← false]
    H --> K{isPrime = true?}
    G -->|No| J[i ← i + 1]
    J --> F
    F -->|No| K
    K -->|Yes| L[/Print Prime/]
    K -->|No| M[/Print Not prime/]
    L --> Z
    M --> Z
